{"content":"\n<p><strong>வாலாஜாநவாப் ஜும்மா பள்ளிவாசல்</strong>, <strong>சிவகங்கை</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure><ul><li><figure><img width=\"764\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/content/2021/10/244991466_1093653071038753_2430009034400609267_n-764x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></li></ul></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><ul><li><figure><img width=\"720\" height=\"960\" src=\"/media/content/2021/10/244985226_1093665021037558_6326437656220132377_n-2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></li><li><figure><img width=\"720\" height=\"960\" src=\"/media/content/2021/10/244804696_1093664711037589_5647296064390892022_n-1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></li></ul></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img width=\"720\" height=\"960\" src=\"/media/content/2021/10/244504250_1093665097704217_6870031194782587406_n-1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><img width=\"720\" height=\"960\" src=\"/media/content/2021/10/244667332_1093664801037580_2913968420005889966_n-1.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<ul><li><strong>புகைப்படம் : தாழை மதியவன்</strong></li></ul>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n","quranRefs":[],"hadithRefs":[],"lang":"ta","wordCount":17,"coverSourceUrl":"http://penakkal.local/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/244985226_1093665021037558_6326437656220132377_n-1.jpg"}